OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police called after boy hurt
OL,4,Anear school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police presence remains in place at
OL,7,Ftwo schools after an altercation left a
OL,8,Fboy injured.
OL,10,FArmed police were called to St Peter's
OL,11,FHigh School in Gloucester earlier after
OL,12,Fa male was seen with a "long-bladed
OL,13,Fitem" nearby, police said. The school
OL,14,Fand Willow Primary Academy were put
OL,15,Finto lockdown while officers searched
OL,16,Ffor the group who had fled the scene,
OL,17,Fpolice said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
